  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>춘<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>하<ruby>츄<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>당<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oFnBwOhSSBE?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>聊<rt>ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>春風<rt>춘ˉ헝ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-liáu’e chūn-hông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>伴<rt>퐐-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>流浪<rt>류렁ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phoa̰-gùn liu-lōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>孤孤單單<rt>거ˉ거ˉ돨ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>體諒<rt>테ˆ령ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kōr-kōr-toā̰-toâ̰ siâ̰-láng thê-liōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>他鄉<rt>타ˉ형ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>受<rt>슈-</rt></ruby><ruby>盡<rt>진-</rt></ruby><ruby>風霜<rt>헝ˉ성ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà jai-thā-hiông siu-jin-hōng-sông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>故鄉<rt>거ˋ형ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>保重<rt>보ˆ뎡ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì jai-kòr-hiông tio-ài-pô-tiōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>中秋<rt>뎡ˉ츄ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>月<rt>뀋-</rt></ruby><ruby>暝<rt>미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>露水<rt>러쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>重<rt>당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tiōng-chiû gueh-mí lor-jùi tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>山頂<rt>솰ˉ뎽ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>菅芒<rt>괄ˉ빵ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>紅<rt>앙ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    soā̰-tièng’e koā̰-báng ya-î-kiēng-áng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>春夏秋冬<rt>춘ˉ하츄ˉ당ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chūn-ha-chiū-tâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-kâng kuè-jit-kâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>對<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tùi-lì’e sū-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為何<rt>위호-</rt></ruby><ruby>離<rt>리-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>開<rt>퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-ho-li-boe-khūi-gùn’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>聊<rt>ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>春風<rt>춘ˉ헝ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-liáu’e chūn-hông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>伴<rt>퐐-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ<